  fn: '* No magic button: the morning work runs as a scheduled task in Claude Cowork, and each meeting prep is scheduled shortly before the meeting. Your computer has to be awake.',
  fnLink: 'How the schedule works',
  chips: ['Free Notion template', 'Built and tested on macOS', 'Beta, used daily by its author', 'Free and open source'],

